// ----- SegTree -----
// Referring to the following great materials.
//  - tsutaj-san's article: https://tsutaj.hatenablog.com/entry/2017/03/30/224339
//  - drken-san's article: https://drken1215.hatenablog.com/entry/2019/02/19/110200
